{"seq":2,"slug":"frontend-error-tracking","title":"前端错误追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/frontend-error-tracking","wordCount":1321,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"前端错误追踪\">前端错误追踪</h1><p>浏览器是唯一一个你无法 SSH 登录的生产环境。用户设备上的 JavaScript 错误、资源加载失败、API 调用异常，要么被静默吞掉，要么以&quot;白屏&quot;的形式呈现给用户——而你在后端日志里看不到任何痕迹。前端错误追踪的目标是：让每一个影响用户体验的异常都被捕获、归因、关联到后端 trace，并最终被修复或有意识地接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前端错误追踪的基本术语决定了捕获与归因链路能否闭合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在追踪中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Runtime Error</td>\n<td>运行中的 JS 异常</td>\n<td>最高优先级错误类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unhandled Rejection</td>\n<td>未处理的 Promise 拒绝</td>\n<td>易被静默吞掉的错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Resource Error</td>\n<td>资源加载失败（需捕获阶段监听）</td>\n<td>视觉降级的来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Source Map</td>\n<td>压缩产物到原始源码的映射</td>\n<td>堆栈可读的前提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Release</td>\n<td>与 source map 对应的版本标识</td>\n<td>反解时匹配正确的 map</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fingerprint</td>\n<td>错误类型 + 归一化栈顶 3 帧</td>\n<td>聚合去重的键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Session Replay</td>\n<td>最小化录制用户操作、DOM 快照</td>\n<td>提供“用户做了什么”的上下文</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些概念串成一条链路：捕获入口产生原始错误 → source map 反解为可读堆栈 → fingerprint 聚合去重 → 关联 trace_id → Session Replay 补全上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误分类体系\">错误分类体系</h2><p>前端错误不是一个同质类别。不同类型的错误需要不同的捕获机制和处理策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>捕获机制</th>\n<th>影响级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JS 运行时错误</td>\n<td><code>TypeError: Cannot read property &#39;x&#39; of undefined</code></td>\n<td><code>window.onerror</code> / <code>window.addEventListener(&#39;error&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>高（功能中断）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Promise 未处理拒绝</td>\n<td><code>UnhandledPromiseRejection</code></td>\n<td><code>window.addEventListener(&#39;unhandledrejection&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源加载失败</td>\n<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 404、CSS 加载超时、字体加载失败</td>\n<td><code>window.addEventListener(&#39;error&#39;, ..., true)</code>（捕获阶段）</td>\n<td>中（视觉降级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 调用异常</td>\n<td>HTTP 5xx、超时、CORS 错误</td>\n<td><code>fetch</code> / <code>XMLHttpRequest</code> instrumentation</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架级错误</td>\n<td>React Error Boundary 捕获的渲染错误</td>\n<td>框架 API（ErrorBoundary、Vue errorHandler）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制台错误</td>\n<td><code>console.error()</code> 输出的业务错误</td>\n<td>Console instrumentation（可选）</td>\n<td>低–中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"错误捕获的完整覆盖\">错误捕获的完整覆盖</h2><p>一个生产级别的前端错误追踪系统需要同时覆盖多个捕获入口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 1. 全局 JS 错误&#10;window.addEventListener(&#39;error&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.error) {&#10;    reportError({&#10;      type: &#39;js_error&#39;,&#10;      message: event.error.message,&#10;      stack: event.error.stack,&#10;      filename: event.filename,&#10;      lineno: event.lineno,&#10;      colno: event.colno,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 2. 未处理的 Promise 拒绝&#10;window.addEventListener(&#39;unhandledrejection&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  reportError({&#10;    type: &#39;unhandled_rejection&#39;,&#10;    message: event.reason?.message || String(event.reason),&#10;    stack: event.reason?.stack,&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 3. 资源加载失败（在捕获阶段监听）&#10;window.addEventListener(&#10;  &#39;error&#39;,&#10;  (event) =&gt; {&#10;    const target = event.target as HTMLElement;&#10;    if (target?.tagName &amp;&amp; !event.error) {&#10;      reportError({&#10;        type: &#39;resource_error&#39;,&#10;        tagName: target.tagName,&#10;        src: (target as HTMLImageElement).src || (target as HTMLLinkElement).href,&#10;      });&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  true,&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 4. React Error Boundary&#10;class ObservabilityErrorBoundary extends React.Component {&#10;  componentDidCatch(error: Error, info: React.ErrorInfo) {&#10;    reportError({&#10;      type: &#39;react_error&#39;,&#10;      message: error.message,&#10;      stack: error.stack,&#10;      componentStack: info.componentStack,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 全局 JS 错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event.error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'js_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: event.error.message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stack: event.error.stack,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      filename: event.filename,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      lineno: event.lineno,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      colno: event.colno,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 未处理的 Promise 拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unhandledrejection'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unhandled_rejection'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    message: event.reason?.message </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.reason),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stack: event.reason?.stack,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 资源加载失败（在捕获阶段监听）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (target?.tagName </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event.error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resource_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tagName: target.tagName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        src: (target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLImageElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).src </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLLinkElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).href,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 4. React Error Boundary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ObservabilityErrorBoundary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  componentDidCatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">info</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ErrorInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'react_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: error.message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stack: error.stack,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      componentStack: info.componentStack,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"错误归因-从堆栈到根因\">错误归因：从堆栈到根因</h2><p>捕获错误只是第一步。生产环境的 JS 通常经过 minification 和 bundling，原始堆栈信息不可读：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"TypeError: Cannot read property &#39;x&#39; of undefined&#10;    at e.render (app.3a7f2b.js:1:29847)&#10;    at t.performUnitOfWork (vendor.8c4e1d.js:1:158923)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>TypeError: Cannot read property 'x' of undefined</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    at e.render (app.3a7f2b.js:1:29847)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    at t.performUnitOfWork (vendor.8c4e1d.js:1:158923)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Source Map 反解</strong> 是必须的基础设施：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    B[Browser: 压缩后错误] --&gt;|error + stack| S[错误收集服务]&#10;    S --&gt;|查询 source map| SM[(Source Map 存储&lt;br/&gt;按 release 版本索引)]&#10;    SM --&gt; S&#10;    S --&gt;|反解后的堆栈| D[Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;原始文件名 + 行号]\">graph LR\n    B[Browser: 压缩后错误] --&gt;|error + stack| S[错误收集服务]\n    S --&gt;|查询 source map| SM[(Source Map 存储&lt;br/&gt;按 release 版本索引)]\n    SM --&gt; S\n    S --&gt;|反解后的堆栈| D[Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;原始文件名 + 行号]</pre><p>关键实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>构建时生成 source map 但<strong>不部署到生产 CDN</strong>（安全考虑）</li>\n<li>Source map 上传到错误追踪服务（Sentry、Grafana Faro），按 <code>release</code> 版本索引</li>\n<li>错误事件携带 <code>release</code> 标识符，服务端据此匹配正确的 source map</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"错误聚合与去噪\">错误聚合与去噪</h2><p>每天数百万条错误上报，逐条处理不现实。关键是<strong>智能聚合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Issue</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>error_type</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>normalized_stack_top_3_frames</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Issue} = \\text{hash}(\\text{error\\_type} + \\text{normalized\\_stack\\_top\\_3\\_frames})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Issue</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">error_type</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">normalized_stack_top_3_frames</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>聚合维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指纹（Fingerprint）</strong>：错误类型 + 归一化后的栈顶 3 帧</li>\n<li><strong>首次出现 / 回归检测</strong>：之前已标记 resolved 的 issue 再次出现时自动重开</li>\n<li><strong>影响面评估</strong>：受影响用户数 × 频率 × 页面重要性</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>去噪策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>浏览器扩展过滤</td>\n<td>堆栈包含 <code>chrome-extension://</code> 的错误不上报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样率限流</td>\n<td>同一 issue 超过 100 次/分钟后降采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已知第三方问题</td>\n<td>标记为 <code>won&#39;t fix</code> 的第三方 SDK 错误不告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旧版本忽略</td>\n<td>超过 2 个版本前的 release 错误降低优先级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与后端-trace-的关联\">与后端 Trace 的关联</h2><p>前端错误不是孤立事件——它往往是后端异常的表现层症状。关联路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>前端 <code>fetch</code> instrumentation 在请求时注入 <code>traceparent</code> header</li>\n<li>后端返回 5xx，前端捕获 API 错误</li>\n<li>错误事件附带 <code>trace_id</code>（从当前活跃 span 提取）</li>\n<li>在错误详情页点击 trace_id，跳转到后端 trace 瀑布图</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function fetchWithTracing(url: string, options?: RequestInit) {&#10;  const span = tracer.startSpan(&#39;fetch&#39;, {&#10;    attributes: { &#39;http.url&#39;: url, &#39;http.method&#39;: options?.method || &#39;GET&#39; },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    const response = await fetch(url, options);&#10;    if (!response.ok) {&#10;      span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.ERROR });&#10;      reportError({&#10;        type: &#39;api_error&#39;,&#10;        url,&#10;        status: response.status,&#10;        traceId: span.spanContext().traceId,&#10;      });&#10;    }&#10;    return response;&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    span.recordException(error as Error);&#10;    reportError({&#10;      type: &#39;network_error&#39;,&#10;      url,&#10;      message: (error as Error).message,&#10;      traceId: span.spanContext().traceId,&#10;    });&#10;    throw error;&#10;  } finally {&#10;    span.end();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchWithTracing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> span</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startSpan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fetch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attributes: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http.url'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: url, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http.method'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: options?.method </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url, options);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response.ok) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        url,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        status: response.status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        traceId: span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">spanContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().traceId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">recordException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'network_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: (error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      traceId: span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">spanContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().traceId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"session-replay-与错误上下文\">Session Replay 与错误上下文</h2><p>堆栈告诉你<strong>代码哪里出错</strong>，Session Replay 告诉你<strong>用户做了什么导致出错</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户操作序列（点击、输入、滚动、路由切换）</li>\n<li>DOM 快照变化（最小化录制方式，非视频）</li>\n<li>网络请求时间线</li>\n<li>Console 输出历史</li>\n</ul>\n<p>隐私处理：输入框内容、敏感元素默认遮罩（<code>data-mask</code> 属性标记），图片替换为占位符。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警策略\">告警策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>告警级别</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0 Critical</td>\n<td>新 issue 影响 &gt; 5% 用户</td>\n<td>立即 page on-call</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1 High</td>\n<td>已有 issue 回归</td>\n<td>工作时间内处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2 Medium</td>\n<td>新 issue 影响 &lt; 1% 用户</td>\n<td>下一 sprint 排入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3 Low</td>\n<td>已知第三方 / 低影响</td>\n<td>监控不处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于前端性能指标的系统化采集（与错误追踪共享 RUM 管道），参见 <a href=\"real-user-monitoring\">真实用户监控（RUM）</a>。Web Vitals 指标的深度优化策略，参见 <a href=\"web-vitals-performance\">Web Vitals 与性能度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>前端错误追踪的目标是让每一个影响用户体验的异常都被捕获、归因、关联到后端 trace。完整覆盖需要同时监听 <code>window.onerror</code>、<code>unhandledrejection</code>、资源错误（捕获阶段）与 React Error Boundary。Source Map 反解是必须的基础设施——上线压缩产物必须能还原到原始文件名与行号。生产环境每天数百万条错误无法逐条处理，因此 fingerprint 聚合、去噪策略（扩展过滤、限流、旧版本降级）与分级告警共同构成工程闭环；而 Session Replay 补全了“用户做了什么导致出错”这一堆栈给不出的上下文。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前端错误追踪","id":"前端错误追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"错误分类体系","id":"错误分类体系"},{"level":2,"text":"错误捕获的完整覆盖","id":"错误捕获的完整覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"错误归因：从堆栈到根因","id":"错误归因-从堆栈到根因"},{"level":2,"text":"错误聚合与去噪","id":"错误聚合与去噪"},{"level":2,"text":"与后端 Trace 的关联","id":"与后端-trace-的关联"},{"level":2,"text":"Session Replay 与错误上下文","id":"session-replay-与错误上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"告警策略","id":"告警策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"真实用户监控（RUM）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/real-user-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"Web Vitals 与性能度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/web-vitals-performance"}}